Package: pulzr-lorawan
Provides: pulzr-cap-lorawan
Depends: pulzr-base, ucode, ucode-mod-fs, ucode-mod-uci, jsonfilter, jshn, ca-bundle, coreutils-stty
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0 AND MIT
Architecture: @ARCH@
Description: A LoRaWAN gateway on the gateway's concentrators.
 ChirpStack Concentratord for each SX130x slot, the MQTT Forwarder to the
 platform, the region and channel plan the console sets, the uplink buffer
 and the receiver's GNSS. Built into the image of a board whose concentrator
 is fitted at the factory; an add-on everywhere else, offered once
 pulzr-probe finds one. See https://oss.pulzr.net/PulzrOS/concentrators.html.
